    heading: "new-features-3",
    content: "Added the `mosValue` member to `RemoteVideoStats` to report a score from 1 (extremely poor video quality with severe blurring) to 5 (excellent video quality with a clear image and no artifacts) for received video quality. This enables real-time monitoring of the subjective quality of remote video streams and helps dynamically adjust video parameters for quality monitoring and alerting. Contact support\\@agora.io to enable this feature."
