    heading: "known-issues-4",
    content: "Starting from v4.5.0, both RTC SDK and Signaling SDK v2.2.0 and later include the `libaosl.dll` library. If you manually integrate RTC SDK through a CDN and also use Signaling SDK, delete the earlier version of `libaosl.dll` to avoid conflicts. You can check the library version in the `libaosl.dll` file properties."
